> What do you think I should use them on?

Speed, magic marker.  Since you have MR and Reflection, the next 
goals are speed, high HP and low AC.  Speed is most essential 
since it allows you to evade most threats.  The marker can be 
used for upgrading your AC.  High HP come naturally, in particular 
if you have high damage so monsters can't use up their healing 
potions before they die.  

Optionally, a wand of polymorph can also help to get e.g. 
useful scrolls from useless ones.  Genociding Ls and hs 
comes to mind.  

If you want to have some fun, you can try for a blessed figurine of an
archon (WARNING:  The archon has a chance to get created hostile).  

Most important advice:  You're far from being invincible.  Be 
afraid of the dangers that still lurk below.  

